[[1,63,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a) and (1b) for the Lambda\nsensors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on pre-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024211\">K15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor downstream of post-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024220\">K17</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001714.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,524288,"<p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3024856\">1072C44</a> .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts fixing the catalytic converter, manifold side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001715.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,524288,"<p>1. Undo the nuts securing the catalytic converter to the engine\nsump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001716.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,524288,"<p>1. Lower the catalytic converter (1a), as necssary, and remove the\ngasket (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001717.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place a new gasket in the housing.</p><p>Place the catalytic converter back in its\nhousing.</p><p>Tighten the nuts fixing the catalyti converter mounting,\ncrankcase sump side.</p><p>1. Tighten the nuts fixing the catalytic converter, manifold side.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>CATALYTIC CONVERTER (ONE)</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Manifold side) 4.1 ÷ 5.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001718.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,524288,"<p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3024856\">1072C44</a> .</p><p>Connect the Lambda probe electrical connections.</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[1,63,1048576,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3024875\">1080B62</a> .</p>"],[1,63,1048576,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3024875\">1080B62</a> .</p>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3024875\">1080B62</a> .</p>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3024875\">1080B62</a> .</p>"],[4,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3024987\">1080B65</a> .</p>"],[4,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3024987\">1080B65</a> .</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing  the pipe to the catalytic converter.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts securing the mounting brackets to the body.</p><p>3. Remove the gasket from its seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002364.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the gasket  into its seat on the catalytic\nconverter.</p><p>Secure the pin to its rubber block.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the exhaust\npipe to the catalytic converter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>EXHAUST PIPE TO ENGINE</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(catalytic converter) 3</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and disconnect the front section of the exhaust\npipe (1b) from the catalytic converter.</p><p>2. Remove the front attachment gasket for the catalytic converter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048420.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the front catalytic converter attachment gasket in the\nhousing.</p><p>2. Place the front section of the exhaust pipe (2a) back in its\nhousing and secure by tightening the nuts (2b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>PRE-CAT CONVERTOR/CAT CONVERTOR PIPE</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Catalytic converter side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048421.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]